    "description": "<p>You shift your features to appear as someone else.</p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Open Sans',sans-serif\"><strong style=\"font-weight:normal;\" id=\"docs-internal-guid-b339b82d-7fff-7e7a-36f4-74bfc0daf8d7\">For </strong><strong>1 hour</strong>,</span> you take the form of another person, or any other similarly shaped creature that you desire.</p><p>Your size and body composition must remain the same, but otherwise you can appear how you wish.</p><p>This effect can change how you sound and feel to other creatures but does not change your clothes or gear.</p><p>Each extra success extends the duration by <strong>+1 hours</strong>.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.kz0syUzsRz4QddmD]{Alter Self}</p>",
